# The company image builds from the repo root, but its Dockerfile consumes only
# the Rust workspace and the image definition. Keep this an allowlist: local
# experiments and company state can be gigabytes and must never enter BuildKit.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!crates/**
!infra/
infra/*
!infra/company-image/
!infra/company-image/**
!infra/account-plane/
!infra/account-plane/**
!tools/
tools/*
!tools/scenario/
!tools/scenario/restless-scenario.mjs
